cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ActBench, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "ActBench: Self-Evolving Benchmark of Behavioral Safety in Cowork Agents"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ActBench evaluates behavioral safety in cowork agents from complete execution
  trajectories. It provides matched benign and adversarial task cases, local
  mock services, trajectory collection, and safety and utility scoring.
